      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "int N = 1e7\n\nint dp[N+10] \n\nf(n):\n    if n==0:\n        return 0\n\n    if n==1:\n        return 1\n\n    if dp[n]!=-1:\n        return dp[n]\n\n    return dp[n] =  f(n-1)+f(n-2)\n\n\nmain():\n\n    n = input()\n\n    for(int i = 0  ; i<=n ;i++)\n        dp[n]=-1\n\n    print(f(n))",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "int N = 1e7\n\nint dp[N+10] \n\nf(n):\n    if n==0:\n        return 0\n\n    if n==1:\n        return 1\n\n    if dp[n]!=-1:\n        return dp[n]\n\n    return dp[n] =  f(n-1)+f(n-2)\n\n\nmain():\n\n    n = input()\n\n    for(int i = 0  ; i<=n ;i++)\n        dp[n]=-1\n\n    print(f(n))",
