      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we have to try every possible ways\nn  =10\nif we start = 1\n         1-> 3 -> 5 -> 7-> 9\n         1 -> 4 -> 6 -> 8 -> 10\n         1 -> 5-> 7 -> 9\n         1 -> 6-> 8 -> 10\n         1 -> 7 -> 9\n         1 -> 10\n        ..\n\nwe start =2\n         2 -> 4 -> 6 -> 8 ->10\n         2 -> 5 -> 7 -> 9\n        .\n        .\n        .\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we have to try every possible ways\nn  =10\nif we start = 1\n         1-> 3 -> 5 -> 7-> 9\n         1 -> 4 -> 6 -> 8 -> 10\n         1 -> 5-> 7 -> 9\n         1 -> 6-> 8 -> 10\n         1 -> 7 -> 9\n         1 -> 10\n        ..\n\nwe start =2\n         2 -> 4 -> 6 -> 8 ->10\n         2 -> 5 -> 7 -> 9\n        .\n        .\n        .\n",
